# {{lb|mul|informal}} A substitute for the modifying diacritic [[ʼ|{{angbr|ʼ}}]] or [[ʹ|{{angbr|ʹ}}]] used in the [[International Phonetic Alphabet]] and other traditions for glottalized or palatalized consonants.
## {{lb|mul|in [[transliterate]]d [[Arabic]] and [[Hebrew]] text}} Transliteration of the [[glottal stop]] ([[hamza]]).
