==German==

===Symbol===
{{head|de|symbol}}

# Indicating the omission of letters.
#* In case of enclitic pronouns: ''wenn es → wenn’s, gibt es → gibt’s''
#* {{qualifier|sometimes proscribed}} In case of merging of prepositions and articles: ''auf dem → auf’m''
#* In case of omission of ''e'' in the present indicative: ''ich gehe → ich geh’, wir/sie gehen → wir/sie geh’n''
#* {{qualifier|sometimes proscribed}} In case of the omission of ''e'' in the imperative singular: gehe du → geh’ du''
#* {{qualifier|archaic}} In case of the omission of ''e'' in the imperative plural: ''gehet ihr → geh’t ihr''
#* {{qualifier|archaic}} In case of the omission of ''e'' in the past participle: ''entdecket → entdeck’t, bezeuget → bezeug’t''
#* {{qualifier|archaic}} In case of the omission of ''e'' in the genitive case: ''Gottes → Gott’s, Königes → König’s''

====Usage notes====
* In many cases where letters are omitted, there are also spellings without an apostrophes (e.g. wenns, aufm, gehn, geh, geht, entdeckt).

